000010*****************************************************************
000020* PROGRAMA : CARGINI                                           *
000030* PROPOSITO: CARGA INICIAL DEL MAESTRO DE LIBROS               *
000040*            DESDE ARCHIVO DE ENTRADA SECUENCIAL               *
000050* AUTOR    : KC03C9E                                           *
000060* FECHA    : 08/11/2025                                        *
000070* VERSION  : 1.0                                               *
000080*****************************************************************
000090* DESCRIPCION GENERAL:                                         *
000100* - LEE ARCHIVO DE ENTRADA  (DDNAME DDIN).                     *
000110* - VALIDA CAMPOS MINIMOS DEL REGISTRO.                        *
000120* - GENERA MAESTRO LIBROS     (DDNAME DDOUT).                  *
000130* - EMITE REPORTE DE CARGA    (DDNAME DDREP).                  *
000140* - UTILIZA COPYBOOKS: LIBRO, CONSTANT, MENSAJES, LINREP.      *
000150*****************************************************************
000160 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000170 PROGRAM-ID. CARGINI.
000180*****************************************************************
000190 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000200 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000210 FILE-CONTROL.
000220     SELECT ARCH-INPUT
000230         ASSIGN TO DDIN
000240         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
000250         ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
000260         FILE STATUS  IS WS-STAT-INPUT.
000270     SELECT ARCH-LIBROS
000280         ASSIGN TO DDOUT
000290         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
000300         ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
000310         FILE STATUS  IS WS-STAT-LIBROS.
000320     SELECT ARCH-REP
000330         ASSIGN TO DDREP
000340         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
000350         ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
000360         FILE STATUS  IS WS-STAT-REP.
000370*****************************************************************
000380 DATA DIVISION.
000390 FILE SECTION.
000400*
000410 FD  ARCH-INPUT
000420     RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS
000430     BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
000440     RECORDING MODE IS F.
000450 01 REG-INPUT                 PIC X(200).
000460*
000470 FD  ARCH-LIBROS
000480     RECORD CONTAINS 250 CHARACTERS
000490     BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
000500     RECORDING MODE IS F.
000510     COPY LIBRO.
000520*
000530 FD  ARCH-REP
000540     RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
000550     BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
000560     RECORDING MODE IS F.
000570 01 REG-REP                   PIC X(133).
000580*****************************************************************
000590 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000600*****************************************************************
000610* COPYBOOKS DE SOPORTE                                         *
000620*****************************************************************
000630     COPY CONSTANT.
000640     COPY MENSAJES.
000650     COPY LINREP.
000660*****************************************************************
000670* VARIABLES DE CONTROL                                         *
000680*****************************************************************
000690 01 WS-STATUS.
000700    05 WS-STAT-INPUT         PIC XX VALUE '00'.
000710    05 WS-STAT-LIBROS        PIC XX VALUE '00'.
000720    05 WS-STAT-REP           PIC XX VALUE '00'.
000730*
000740 01 WS-FLAGS.
000750    05 WS-FIN                PIC X  VALUE 'N'.
000760       88 FIN-ARCHIVO               VALUE 'S'.
000770    05 WS-VALID-FLAG         PIC X  VALUE 'S'.
000780       88 VALID-OK                  VALUE 'S'.
000790       88 VALID-NOK                 VALUE 'N'.
000800*
000810 01 WS-CONTADORES.
000820    05 WS-LEIDOS             PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
000830    05 WS-OK                 PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
000840    05 WS-ERR                PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
000850*****************************************************************
000860* CAMPOS PARSEADOS DESDE REG-INPUT                             *
000870*****************************************************************
000880 01 WS-INPUT-FIELDS.
000890    05 IN-CODIGO             PIC X(10).
000900    05 IN-TITULO             PIC X(60).
000910    05 IN-AUTOR              PIC X(40).
000920    05 IN-EDITORIAL          PIC X(30).
000930    05 IN-CATEGORIA          PIC X(20).
000940    05 IN-STOCK              PIC 9(3).
000950    05 IN-UBICACION          PIC X(10).
000960*****************************************************************
000970* VARIABLES PARA MOSTRAR TOTALES FORMATEADOS                   *
000980*****************************************************************
000990 01 WS-DISP-TOTALES.
001000    05 WS-DISP-LEIDOS        PIC Z(6)9.
001010    05 WS-DISP-OK            PIC Z(6)9.
001020    05 WS-DISP-ERR           PIC Z(6)9.
001030*****************************************************************
001040 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001050 MAIN-SECTION.
001060     PERFORM INICIALIZAR
001070     PERFORM PROCESAR
001080     PERFORM FINALIZAR
001090     GOBACK.
001100*****************************************************************
001110 INICIALIZAR.
001120     OPEN INPUT  ARCH-INPUT
001130          OUTPUT ARCH-LIBROS
001140          OUTPUT ARCH-REP
001150*
001160     MOVE SPACES TO REG-REP
001170     MOVE LINEA-CABECERA TO REG-REP
001180     WRITE REG-REP.
001190*****************************************************************
001200 PROCESAR.
001210     PERFORM LEER-REGISTRO
001220     PERFORM UNTIL FIN-ARCHIVO
001230        ADD 1 TO WS-LEIDOS
001240        PERFORM PARSEAR-REGISTRO
001250        PERFORM VALIDAR-REGISTRO
001260        IF VALID-OK
001270           PERFORM GRABAR-LIBRO
001280           PERFORM GRABAR-DETALLE-OK
001290        ELSE
001300           PERFORM GRABAR-DETALLE-ERROR
001310        END-IF
001320        PERFORM LEER-REGISTRO
001330     END-PERFORM.
001340*****************************************************************
001350 LEER-REGISTRO.
001360     READ ARCH-INPUT
001370         AT END
001380            MOVE 'S' TO WS-FIN
001390     END-READ.
001400*****************************************************************
001410 PARSEAR-REGISTRO.
001420* FORMATO DE ENTRADA (LRECL=200)
001430     MOVE REG-INPUT(1:10)    TO IN-CODIGO
001440     MOVE REG-INPUT(11:60)   TO IN-TITULO
001450     MOVE REG-INPUT(71:40)   TO IN-AUTOR
001460     MOVE REG-INPUT(111:30)  TO IN-EDITORIAL
001470     MOVE REG-INPUT(141:20)  TO IN-CATEGORIA
001480     MOVE REG-INPUT(161:3)   TO IN-STOCK
001490     MOVE REG-INPUT(164:10)  TO IN-UBICACION.
001500*****************************************************************
001510 VALIDAR-REGISTRO.
001520     SET VALID-OK TO TRUE
001530*
001540     IF IN-CODIGO = SPACES
001550        SET VALID-NOK TO TRUE
001560     END-IF
001570*
001580     IF IN-TITULO = SPACES
001590        SET VALID-NOK TO TRUE
001600     END-IF
001610*
001620     IF IN-STOCK = ZERO
001630        SET VALID-NOK TO TRUE
001640     END-IF.
001650*****************************************************************
001660 GRABAR-LIBRO.
001670     MOVE IN-CODIGO       TO LIB-CODIGO
001680     MOVE IN-TITULO       TO LIB-TITULO
001690     MOVE IN-AUTOR        TO LIB-AUTOR
001700     MOVE IN-EDITORIAL    TO LIB-EDITORIAL
001710     MOVE IN-CATEGORIA    TO LIB-CATEGORIA
001720     MOVE IN-STOCK        TO LIB-STOCK-TOTAL
001730     MOVE IN-STOCK        TO LIB-STOCK-DISPONIBLE
001740     MOVE IN-UBICACION    TO LIB-UBICACION
001750*
001760     WRITE REG-LIBRO
001770     IF WS-STAT-LIBROS = "00"
001780        ADD 1 TO WS-OK
001790     ELSE
001800        ADD 1 TO WS-ERR
001810     END-IF.
001820*****************************************************************
001830 GRABAR-DETALLE-OK.
001840     MOVE SPACES TO REG-REP
001850     MOVE IN-CODIGO     TO LIN-CODIGO
001860     MOVE IN-TITULO     TO LIN-TITULO
001870     MOVE "OK"          TO LIN-RESULTADO
001880     MOVE LINEA-DETALLE TO REG-REP
001890     WRITE REG-REP.
001900*****************************************************************
001910 GRABAR-DETALLE-ERROR.
001920     ADD 1 TO WS-ERR
001930     MOVE SPACES TO REG-REP
001940     MOVE IN-CODIGO     TO LIN-CODIGO
001950     MOVE IN-TITULO     TO LIN-TITULO
001960     MOVE "ERROR"       TO LIN-RESULTADO
001970     MOVE LINEA-DETALLE TO REG-REP
001980     WRITE REG-REP.
001990*****************************************************************
002000 FINALIZAR.
002010     MOVE WS-LEIDOS TO WS-DISP-LEIDOS
002020     MOVE WS-OK     TO WS-DISP-OK
002030     MOVE WS-ERR    TO WS-DISP-ERR
002040*
002050     MOVE SPACES               TO REG-REP
002060     MOVE "TOTAL LEIDOS    : " TO REG-REP(1:19)
002070     MOVE WS-DISP-LEIDOS       TO REG-REP(21:7)
002080     WRITE REG-REP
002090*
002100     MOVE SPACES               TO REG-REP
002110     MOVE "TOTAL OK        : " TO REG-REP(1:19)
002120     MOVE WS-DISP-OK           TO REG-REP(21:7)
002130     WRITE REG-REP
002140*
002150     MOVE SPACES               TO REG-REP
002160     MOVE "TOTAL CON ERROR : " TO REG-REP(1:19)
002170     MOVE WS-DISP-ERR          TO REG-REP(21:7)
002180     WRITE REG-REP
002190*
002200     CLOSE ARCH-INPUT ARCH-LIBROS ARCH-REP.
